#: launcher/ui/pages/global/MeshMCPage.ui:531
msgctxt "MeshMCPage|"
msgid "<html><head/>\n"
"<body>\n"
"<p>MeshMC sends anonymous usage statistics on every start of the application.</p><p>The following data is collected:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>MeshMC version.</li>\n"
"<li>Operating system name, version and architecture.</li>\n"
"<li>CPU architecture (kernel architecture on linux).</li>\n"
"<li>Size of system memory.</li>\n"
"<li>Java version, architecture and memory settings.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/>\n"
"<body>\n"
"<p>MeshMC envoie des statistiques d'utilisation anonymes à chaque démarrage de l'application.</p><p>Les données suivantes sont collectées :</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Version MeshMC.</li>\n"
"<li>Nom du système d'exploitation, version et architecture.</li>\n"
